- All supplied basic commands worked: adding the todo, deadline and event; `list`; `find report`; `mark 1-3`; `unmark 1 3`; and `delete 2 3`.
- Added enough tasks to test `mark 1 3-5 7`. It correctly marked exactly tasks 1, 3, 4, 5 and 7, leaving tasks 2 and 6 incomplete.
- All supplied invalid inputs produced helpful errors without crashing:
  - `todo`
  - `mark abc`
  - `unmark -2`
  - `delete`
  - `deadline study`
  - `event meeting friend /from 20/09/2023 2300 /to 20/09/2023 2000`
- `bye` closed the application successfully.
- Reopening from the same folder restored all seven remaining tasks with the correct completion states. Previously deleted tasks stayed deleted.

No unexpected functional behaviour or crashes encountered. A JavaFX native-access warning appeared at startup but did not prevent operation. Screenshots attached.

