Tested on **macOS 26.5.2, Apple Silicon (arm64), Azul OpenJDK 25.0.3**.

**Smoke test passed for the checks performed.** Launched with `java -jar groot.jar` in a fresh folder without existing data.

Commands tested:
'''bash
todo Read a book
deadline Zebra /by 2026-10-20
