Actual: the task is added with `28/2/2026`, and this changed date persists. The GUI says `Got it, friend. I've added this task: [D][ ] bad (by: 28/2/2026)`. See `14-command.png`. No related terminal exception was printed.

The terminal printed a JavaFX native-access warning, but it did not prevent launch. No crashes encountered.

