**Smoke test passed for the checks performed on A-Release.** Launched with `java -jar gudgoi.jar` in a fresh folder without existing data. The forum's named release was unavailable; see below.

Commands tested:
'''bash
todo read book
deadline submit report /by 2026-09-25 1800
