**40 :fas-comment:**
</div>

Hi, thanks for following up.

This was likely a date-format mismatch on my side, not a persistence bug.

I launched `linus.jar` from an empty folder and entered:

1. `todo read chapter 5`
2. `deadline submit report /by 12/9/2026 1800`
3. `event project meeting /from 12/9/2026 1400 /to 12/9/2026 1600`
4. `list`
5. `mark 1`
6. `find report`
7. `blargh`

Then I closed the app, relaunched from the same folder, and ran `list`.

Your UG asks for `yyyy-MM-dd`, so the deadline/event commands were probably rejected. `find report` returned no matches, and after restart `list` only showed the marked todo `1. [T][X] read chapter 5`. The todo and its marked status did persist.
</panel>

</panel>


