## Request for Help with Smoke Testing

Hello friends, please help smoke test **Stewie** on **Windows, macOS, or Linux**! I’d like to check whether `stewie.jar` launches and works correctly on other environments. The file size in my previous version was much larger than the accepted size. So I made a new JAR file with smaller size in this version. 

### Preparation

1. Install **Java 25** and check your version using `java -version`.
2. Download `stewie.jar` from the releases page linked below.
3. Place it in an empty folder.
4. Open a terminal in that folder and run:

'''bash
java -jar "stewie.jar"
'''

### Links

1. [User guide](https://winhks25.github.io/ip/)
2. [Releases](https://github.com/winhks25/ip/releases/tag/release3.0)

### Test checklist

Please run these checks **in order**, starting with an empty task list:

- [ ] The GUI opens without an error.
- [ ] The complete window displays correctly, including icons, text, and buttons.
- [ ] The **Chat**, **My List**, and **Help** views open correctly.
- [ ] `todo read book` adds a task.
- [ ] `deadline submit report /by 2026-09-30` adds a deadline.
- [ ] `event meeting /from 2026-09-29 /to 2026-09-30` adds an event.
- [ ] `list` displays all three tasks.
- [ ] `update 2 d/2026-10-01` changes the report’s deadline.
- [ ] `mark 1` marks the reading task as completed.
- [ ] `unmark 1` marks it as incomplete again.
- [ ] `find book` finds the reading task.
- [ ] `list`, followed by `delete 3`, removes the meeting.
- [ ] `oops` displays a helpful error without closing the app.
- [ ] Closing and reopening Stewie **from the same folder** preserves the two remaining tasks and the updated deadline.
- [ ] `bye` displays a farewell. The GUI currently stays open; close the window to exit.

### Results

Feel free to use this format:

'''text
Operating system and version:
Processor architecture (e.g. Intel/AMD x64 or Apple Silicon):
Java version (output of java -version):
JAR launched successfully: Yes/No
Checklist items that failed:
Error message, if any:
Additional observations:
'''

If anything fails, please attach a screenshot and include the complete error message shown in the terminal.

Thanks for helping test Stewie! 😄



