<img width="1470" height="820" alt="Image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/28b50bab-972d-4c57-a337-fc8ba7cdde66" />

I found a workaround which is to do it through create 'New Issue'.

1. Go to Issues.
2. Click 'New issue'.
3. Click the 'Gear' icon beside Labels at the right side of the page.
4. Type the full name of the label. If it is not a prefix of another label it prompts you to create a new label.
5. Click 'Create new label: [label name]'.

