Nvm I found out it was a combination of small mistakes on our gradle.yml file. First, we had an error where the node_modules were causing an error, so we added it to the .gitignore. Then there was trailing whitespaces on one of our lines that we never noticed and a missing \n at the EOF. If anyone else faces an error like this, it's better to look through the details of why the error is happening and slowly fix it from there. Thank you!
</panel>

