i think the distinction in the latest comment is a bit too strict. As Prof clarified [above](https://github.com/NUS-CS2103-AY2627-S1/forum/issues/450#issuecomment-5732486265), the intended implementation could pass the `ParserFactory` object itself using `new Parser(this)`. `Parser` can then invoke `getInfo()` through that object reference, so an explicit method reference such as `factory::getInfo` isn't required for it to be a callback here.

Passing the method reference would be another possible implementation, but it would make the diagram describe a more specific design than the one intended.

</panel>

