> '''java
> 
>     public String getResponse(String input) ``{``
>         // long method
>     ``}``
> 
> '''
> 
> '''java
> 
>     private static Task parseLine(final String line) throws ClaraException ``{``
>         // long method
>     ``}``
> 
> '''
> ...
> 

Well, if the method is long, perhaps a good choice for it would be... not displaying the long method in full? An option would be an abbreviated version - perhaps the first and last K lines of the method? (Won't have overlapping issues because of the size defined in the ruleset) I think this is a (miniscule) improvement that's easy to implement.
