<panel  popup-url="https://github.com/NUS-CS2103-AY2627-S1/forum/issues/80#issuecomment-5440763377" expanded>
<div slot="header">

**2 :fas-comment:**
</div>

> > Nice work, [@dillionlim](https://github.com/dillionlim)
> > One thing though: Try not to reveal the mapping between the partial student number and the person's identity, as this weakens the anonymity of the dashboards of the course.
> 
> Yep thanks prof. Anyways, the intention was for the dashboards to be used within the team itself (you set the mapping of partial student IDs -&gt; identity yourself, and you should not be sharing this link around to everyone anyways, and everything is self-hosted), and I believe within the team you do know your teammates' names 😃
> 
> But if people were really concerned, they can just choose not to not map names (just put placeholder names I guess).

