I think you can make MSG_HELP private and use a public method to retrieve it. The checkstyle declaration order requires public fields to appear before private fields, but this rule does not require public methods to appear before private fields.

//make MSG_HELP private
private static final String MSG_HELP = ...

//Call Message.getHelpMessage() instead of Message.MSG_HELP
public static String getHelpMessage() ``{``
    return MSG_HELP; 
``}``
</panel>

