- [x] Enlarged and restored the window; the content reflowed and the input/Send button stayed visible.
- [x] Added todos, deadlines and events; tested list, mark, unmark, edit and delete.
- [x] `find ESSAY, chapters` returned both matching tasks.
- [x] Dates/times displayed correctly, including `2026-10-15 1800`, `16/10/2026 23:59` and `2026-10-15 17:00`.
