I personally use codex luna high only. Its more than enough for this iP, as long as you give it clear, direct instructions. And don't touch Fast Mode, it burns tokens at a much higher rate.

I also give it clear boundaries, for example:
Do not scan build or log files.
Only inspect ``{``files``}`` needed for this bug.
Do not paste full files unless I ask.

Also Codex (especially sol) tend to get stuck in validation/testing loops. I always explicitly instruct it not to do that. Helps a lot with both token usage and speed.
</panel>

