**3. :fas-info-circle: Git conventions conflict with iP tasks on branch naming**
</div>

According to Git conventions, branch names should be in kebab case ie all lower case letters. However, in relevant iP tasks, we are to follow the naming convention e.g "branch-Level-8" where it is not all in lower case letters. May I clarify on which branch naming conventions should we use?

<img width="982" height="100" alt="Image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d10de1fa-6a90-4aac-a81b-3ea671304cc7" />

