If the AI generates thousands of lines at once, you still need to check that they satisfy every requirement. Reviewing a huge generated change can be harder than implementing and verifying smaller increments. After all this module teaches to work on the module incrementally. 
Not just that, you can lose control over how your code is organised which makes later debugging and any requirement change modifications much harder.
