Verbose allowed me to track the root cause of my problem. I changed my GitHub email privacy settings a few days ago, which caused GitHub to reject my pushes here. So despite the success message, my pushes were not going through. I have since reverted that setting, and the progress is now displaying correctly. A new PR has also been created successfully.

Here is the error:
'''remote: error: GH007: Your push would publish a private email address.'''

