<panel  popup-url="https://github.com/NUS-CS2103-AY2627-S1/forum/issues/320" expanded>
<div slot="header">

**1. :fas-info-circle: Request to help with smoke testing JAR file**
</div>

[JAR file](https://github.com/less413/ip/releases/tag/A-Release)
[User Guide](https://less413.github.io/ip/)
OS'es to test on: ~Mac~, **Linux**
Things to check specifically:

- [ ] GUI opens and visually looks something like [this](https://less413.github.io/ip/Ui.png) (no missing ui elements etc)
- [ ] todo task is added on `todo buy groceries` command
- [ ] deadline task is added on `deadline submit assignment /by 2026-09-18` command
- [ ] event task is added on `event party /from 2026-09-18 /to 2026-09-20` command
- [ ] task list (containing the three tasks above) is displayed on `list` command
- [ ] the first task (the todo) is marked on `mark 1` command
- [ ] the second task (the deadline) is deleted on `delete 2` command
- [ ] finding tasks using `find &lt;keyword>` command works
- [ ] the `data/dog.txt` file is created and always updated with the latest task list
- [ ] when closing (with `bye` command/directly closing the window itself) and relaunching the app, the task list is loaded successfully

Guide for testers:
* Put the JAR file in an empty folder
