Hello! Looking for some help to smoke test my Gnaix Application!

Link to JAR file: [Download Gnaix JAR](https://github.com/jixiang-t/ip/releases/download/v0.2/gnaix.jar)
Link to the User Guide: [Gnaix User Guide](https://jixiang-t.github.io/ip/)
Which OS'es to test on: Mac and Linux

Things to check specifically:
  * Check that the JavaFX GUI launches normally without requiring any additional files.
  * Try adding a todo, deadline, and event.
  * Try `list`, `mark`, `unmark`, `delete`, `find`, `date`, and `tag`.
  * Try tags on tasks and a multiple-tag search such as `tag #school #urgent`.
  * Close and reopen Gnaix, then check that the tasks are still there.
  * Check that Gnaix creates/uses its data file correctly from the folder containing the JAR.
  * Resize the window and check that task cards, text, tags, and scrolling display properly.
  * Try an invalid command and confirm that an error is shown without the application crashing.
  * Please report any crashes, layout problems, missing images/resources, or unexpected behaviour.

Guide for testers:
* Post screenshots from your smoke tests
* Mention which OS you used for testing
* If something fails, please include the command/input used and any terminal error output.

Thank you!

</panel>

