<div slot="header">

**1. :fas-info-circle: Request for help with smoke testing JAR file**
</div>

Hi! I would appreciate help testing my task chatbot, **Fein**.

## Getting started

- **JAR:** (https://github.com/cibichandar/ip/releases/tag/v0.3)
- **User Guide:** (https://cibichandar.github.io/ip/)](https://cibichandar.github.io/ip/)
- **Java version:** Java 25
- **Operating systems requested:** Windows, macOS, and Linux

Please download `fein.jar`, place it in an empty folder, open a terminal in that folder, and run:

'''bash
java -jar fein.jar
'''

The Fein GUI should open within a few seconds.

## Things to check

Here are some commands you could try:

'''text
todo smoke test task
deadline submit report /by 2/12/2026 1800
event team meeting /from 2pm /to 4pm
list
find report
mark 1
unmark 1
delete 1
help
'''

Please also check that Fein handles these situations without crashing:

- Enter an unrecognised command, e.g. `dance`.
- Enter repeated spaces, e.g. `todo buy    milk`.
- Test duplicates: enter `todo add report`, then `todo Add report`.
- Enter an invalid date: `deadline submit report /by 31/6/2026`.
- Resize the window and check that the chat and input area remain usable.
- Add a task, exit with `bye`, reopen Fein from the same folder, and run `list` to check that the task remains saved.

## Feedback requested

Please include:

- Your operating system and Java version.
- Whether the JAR launched successfully.
- Screenshots of any unexpected behaviour or error message.
- Any suggestions that would make Fein easier or more pleasant to use.

Thank you for helping me test Fein!
</panel>

