**4 :fas-comment:**
</div>

Yep, as the previous people have mentioned, definitely shouldn't need a justification for a longer method. In fact, I would say the code itself should be the best justification of whether it requires so many lines of code by how readable it is as well as the levels of abstraction.

If you want, maybe you could let us know which method you're talking about and we could help review it for you and give feedback on the length and readability?
