Thanks a lot for the thorough testing and the reproduction steps! When I first implemented `find` I thought the requirement was to have a static list numbering. But thinking about it, it's silly to have different numbers, forcing users to use list again just to find the matching tasks from `find`. This bug flows to other commands as well, such as `mark`. 

I’ve updated SlotBot so `find `now preserves the original task numbers instead of renumbering the search results. 

