```

Apart from a few minor inconsistencies, my testing found one clear bug.

Confirmed issue: surrounding whitespace is ignored by bye
Severity: Low
Steps to reproduce:

1. Launch Ruby.
2. Enter  bye with a leading space or bye  with a trailing space.
3. Submit the command.

\
Expected:
Ruby should reject the command because the User Guide states that leading and trailing spaces are not allowed. The window should remain open.
\
Actual:
Ruby exits and closes the window.

\
Notes:
This is inconsistent with the documented command rules. I tested both leading and trailing spaces, and both inputs closed the application. No data loss was observed because changes are saved immediately.
I cannot screenshot this as the window closes immediately. 
The previous tester also reported that bye is handled case-insensitively, there might be a special case for "bye" where you used input.trim() or ingorecase. 

\
\
Other minor suggestions
- The User Guide’s quick-start section recommends only ./gradlew run. Since testers and end users receive a JAR, it may be helpful to document:  `java -jar ruby.jar`
- There is a slight inconsistency in the error-message detail. Some messages are especially helpful because they provide the valid range of task or contact numbers. Invalid date and time messages only provide the required format. Maybe you could consider specific error messages for them. 
- User Guide allows both deadline to be made with or without HHmm. It intends to display HHmm whenever entered. However, an explicitly entered midnight time is hidden:
  `deadline midnight /by 2026-10-15 0000`
  Ruby displays this as a date-only deadline rather than showing 00:00. This makes an explicit midnight deadline visually indistinguishable from one entered without a time. 
  <img width="442" height="345" alt="Midnight deadline displayed without its time" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1c4372de-91b8-4da9-a65b-cddf7bcb4bcb" />

\
\
Screenshots of working commands:

Todo and deadline
<img width="448" height="515" alt="Todo and deadline commands" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a030f902-3035-4940-a4df-2855bb46afad" />

Event
<img width="430" height="185" alt="Event command" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2c83ce5e-108c-4e80-825a-ae6b93123816" />

