Another workaround to try: select the relevant control in the **Hierarchy** panel, then expand **Code** in the right-hand Inspector and check its **fx:id** field. This should let you inspect each ID while continuing the tutorial, although it won’t fix the narrow column.

The field is documented in Oracle’s [Scene Builder guide](https://docs.oracle.com/javase/8/scene-builder-2/user-guide/inspector-panel.htm). That documentation covers an older version, so I haven’t confirmed this workaround in SceneBuilder 26.0.0.
