Tested with MacOS
Hi nje14, the flaw i found with respect to your current chatbot is with respect to date handling.
As can be seen from the screenshot, invalid dates such as 29 February on a non-leap year, 30 February and 31st April are being handled by being approximated to the closest possible date. However, as these are invalid dates, I think it would be more appropriate for you to throw invalid date error rather than accept it to the closest date as it could lead to unpredicted behaviour. (e.g. Did 31st April actually refer to 1st May?)
</panel>

