The JAR launched successfully with `java -jar Yun.jar` from an otherwise empty folder. Adding todos, deadlines, and events worked, along with `mark`, `unmark`, `list`, `find`, `help`, and `bye`. After closing with `bye` and reopening, all three tasks and the marked status were preserved. `find TEAM` matched `team sprint`, and `mark 0` showed a friendly error without closing the app.

