- [User Guide](https://github.com/HoneycombHen/ip/blob/master/docs/README.md)
- Which OS'es to test on: Windows | macOS | Linux
- Java requirement: JDK 25

- Things to check specifically:
  - Launch the JAR successfully with `java -jar bob.jar`.
  - Verify that the GUI opens with the correct title, welcome message, and avatars.
  - Create different task types:
    - `todo buy groceries`
    - `deadline submit report /by 2026-10-15`
    - `event team meeting /from 2026-10-16 09:00 /to 2026-10-16 10:00`
  - View and search tasks:
    - `list`
    - `upcoming`
    - `upcoming 14`
    - `on 2026-10-16`
    - `overdue`
    - `find report`
  - Update and remove tasks:
    - `mark 1`
    - `unmark 1`
    - `delete 1`
  - Verify undo functionality with `undo`.
  - Verify that tasks are saved and loaded correctly after restarting the JAR.
  - Try an invalid command and confirm that Bob displays an error message without crashing.
  - Enter `bye` and verify that Bob displays the farewell message.

Guide for testers:

- Post screenshots from your smoke tests.
- Mention which OS and JDK version you used.
- Report any commands that fail and include the observed error message.
</panel>

