<panel  popup-url="https://github.com/NUS-CS2103-AY2627-S1/forum/issues/155#issuecomment-5552990615" expanded>
<div slot="header">

**3 :fas-comment:**
</div>

**Propose to close this issue.** 

Appreciate all the discussion and advice, @Bruhmiuz and @spencercdz! 

I agree that **Spotless** and **Checkstyle** can smoothly coexist. After working through the configuration with Codex, I was able to reconcile the AddressBook Level 3 (AB3) setup with Spotless.

### Key Takeaways

* **SE-EDU Enforcement:** Maintained the standard SE-EDU Checkstyle configurations while keeping Spotless active for automatic code formatting.
* **Conflict Resolution:** Configured Codex to detect and highlight any rule discrepancies between Checkstyle and Spotless so I can manually adjust either rule set as needed.

