Hi, in the tP grading information page (https://nus-cs2103-ay2627-s1.github.io/website/admin/tp-grading.html#4-project-grading-documentation-10-marks) there is some duplication of content.

Where: Section 4. Project Grading: Documentation, after "In addition, UG and DG bugs you received in the PE will be considered for grading this component."

The panel for DG bugs contains a collapsible panel inside that when expanded has the same information as the UG bugs panel.

Truncated UG bugs panel:
<img width="1348" height="497" alt="Image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/36f20a14-1f57-47dc-ace9-58de418035cf" />

DG bugs panel with the duplicated content expanded:
<img width="1342" height="680" alt="Image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/bda85422-bcda-40de-85e2-68fb3ee136e1" />

