Hi everyone! Could you help smoke-test **Rei v0.2.1**, my task-management chatbot? It has been tested on Windows with Java 25, and I would especially appreciate testing on macOS and Linux.

* **Link to JAR file:** [rei.jar](https://github.com/nivremi/ip/releases/download/v0.2.1/rei.jar)
* **Link to the User Guide:** [Rei User Guide](https://nivremi.github.io/ip/)
* **Which OSes to test on:** macOS and Linux in particular; additional Windows checks are welcome.
* **Java version required:** Java 25. Please check with `java -version`.

### Things to check specifically

1. Download the JAR into an empty, writable folder. Open a terminal in that folder and run:
   '''text
   java -jar rei.jar
   '''
2. Check that the GUI opens and remains usable when resized.
3. Try the following commands to add, organize, and find tasks:
   '''text
   todo read chapter 6
   deadline submit report /by 2026-09-18 1800
   event study group /from 2026-09-18 1400 /to 2026-09-18 1600
   tag 1 #school
   mark 1
   list
   find #school
   find 2026-09-18
   unmark 1
   delete 3
   '''
4. Try `mark 99` and `deadline invalid date /by 2026-02-30 1800`. Check that errors are displayed clearly and you can still run `list` afterwards.
5. Type `bye` and check that the window closes. Restart from the same folder, run `list`, and check that the two remaining tasks and the `#school` tag were saved.

### Guide for testers

Please reply with:
* Your OS/version and CPU architecture (e.g. Apple Silicon or Intel/AMD).
* Your Java version.
* Whether the smoke test passed or failed.
* Screenshots from the smoke test, and any error messages or unexpected behaviour (including terminal output if the JAR cannot start).

Thank you for your help!

