<panel  popup-url="https://github.com/NUS-CS2103-AY2627-S1/forum/issues/449" expanded>
<div slot="header">

**1. :fas-info-circle: Request to help with smoke testing JAR file**
</div>

* Link to JAR file (please try v0.3): https://github.com/chester-wong-33/ip/releases
* Link to the User Guide: https://chester-wong-33.github.io/ip/
* Which OS'es to test on: Mac | Linux
