Try doing this, temporarily add `stage.setResizable(false)`. If you can still resize the window, the WM is ignoring window hints in general and it's not your code.

If that's it then try doing this instead

'''java
stage.widthProperty().addListener((o, a, b) -&gt; ``{``
    if (b.doubleValue() &lt; 417) stage.setWidth(417);
``}``);
'''

Or just run it on Windows directly.
