'''text
todo Read book
deadline Submit assignment /by 2026-09-25 1800
event Team meeting /from 2026-09-25 1400 /to 2026-09-25 1600
list
find book
mark 1
unmark 1
contact add Jane /phone 91234567 /email jane@example.com
contact list
deadline Homework /by 2026-02-30
mark 99
bye
'''

Reopen Ruby and try `list` and `contact list` to check persistence.
You can also try `delete 1` and `contact delete 1`.

Please include:
- Your OS and Java version.
- Screenshots of your tests.
- Any launch failures, visual issues, or behaviour that differs from the User Guide.

Thank you!
