10. Try invalid commands and confirm that Chris displays helpful error messages without crashing.
11. Close and reopen Chris, then check that previously added tasks are restored.
12. Resize the application and confirm that the interface remains usable.
13. Exit the application using `bye`.

Thank you for helping to test Chris!
