Here's my GUI which definitely needs more aesthetic work...

I thought of Spiderman's AI (E.V.) for this iP but could not find a decent image to represent it. Hence the substitution (ball knowledge required).

I've implemented the following features:
1. Circular avatars, but am still undecided on continuing with this. 
2. A 1.5 second delay on the command "bye" followed by the window closing, which leaves the user ample time to read the exit message. AI was useful in helping me locate the relevant libraries to make this happen.
3. A visual hover effect over the "send" button.
4. Gradient effect text bubbles (definitely needs improvement!)

Note: I've also removed the `maxHeight` attribute once I made the window resizable, because leaving it there would leave large gaps between messages.
