   '''text
   java -jar "choo.jar"
   '''

## Test checklist

Please check that the complete JavaFX GUI opens, the CHOO title and avatars
display correctly, and the layout remains readable when the window is
resized. Try submitting commands using both **Enter** and **Send**.

Starting with an empty task list, enter these commands one at a time:

