### Smoke test request: Kaykay

Kaykay is a JavaFX desktop app for managing tasks and recording places. Thanks for helping test it!

- **Link to JAR:** [Latest release — download ](https://github.com/USER-LRK/ip/releases/latest)
- **User Guide:** https://user-lrk.github.io/ip/
- **OSes to test:** Windows, macOS, and Linux
- **Requirement:** Java 25

### Things to check specifically

1. **Launching:** Put the JAR in an empty folder and run:
   '''text
   java -jar kaykay.jar
   '''
   Check that the GUI opens without errors.

2. **Task commands:** Run:
   '''text
   todo review notes
   deadline submit report /by 25 12 2026 18:30
   event team meeting /from 26 12 2026 14:00 /to 26 12 2026 16:00
   mark 1
   list
   '''
   Check that all three tasks appear, the todo is completed, and dates display like `25 Dec 2026, 18:30`.

3. **Place commands:** Run:
   '''text
