    - Does the app window open correctly, with the layout, fonts, and Carlo's
      picture all displaying properly (JavaFX rendering can look different
      across OSes)
    - Add a todo, a deadline, and an event using the forms — do they show up
      correctly in the Todos/Deadlines/Events columns?
    - Try an invalid date (e.g. "next week") for a deadline/event — does
      Carlo show a sensible error instead of crashing?
    - Select a task and try Mark done, Unmark, and Delete — do the columns
      update as expected?
    - Try Find and Show date — do they filter the columns correctly, and
      does Show all bring everything back?
    - Close the app, then reopen it — are your tasks still there?
    - Check that a `data/carlo.txt` file appears in the same folder as the
      jar (not somewhere else) — this catches hard-coded file path bugs
</panel>

