This happens on every verify and also setup, I suspect github's servers are dropping the connection for whatever reason since I had to rerun the command multiple times hoping that github's servers would allow me through. Tracing the stack and from what I can infer from the public repo this line looks like a possible culprit: https://github.com/git-mastery/app/blob/cd13940701ee4949abdfa8af672db816f1f90d7d/app/cli.py#L42

