<img width="520" height="760" alt="Image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/af00d002-7fc3-4ffb-b895-cbfb41507d13" />
<img width="520" height="760" alt="Image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/fcf00441-94e2-41d4-bd13-e013bab3e8bb" />
<img width="520" height="760" alt="Image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/10607ab7-d21b-4e50-b8fb-0ac547f4d41c" />

