java -jar altair.jar

Test these

todo finish report
deadline submit assignment /by 2025-12-01
event team sync /from 2025-11-01 /to 2025-11-02
list
mark 2
unmark 2
find report
delete 3

Duplicate detection —> add the same task twice, confirm it asks y/n before adding a second copy:

todo finish report
todo finish report

Bad input —> should error, not crash:

todo
deadline x /by whenever
event x /from 2025-12-02 /to 2025-12-01
mark 999

Persistence —> bye, relaunch, list: tasks should still be there.

Do report your OS, and the exact command + error if something breaks.

