</div>


<panel  popup-url="https://github.com/NUS-CS2103-AY2627-S1/forum/issues/332" expanded>
<div slot="header">

**1. :fas-info-circle: Request to help with smoke testing JAR file**
</div>

* Link to JAR file: https://github.com/ys-243/ip/releases
* Link to the User Guide: https://ys-243.github.io/ip/
* Which OS'es to test on: Windows | Mac | Linux
* Things to check specifically: todo, event, deadline, sort, on 


Guide for testers:
* Post screenshots from your smoke tests
