* Which OS'es to test on: Windows (tested and runs locally) | Mac | Linux
* Things to check specifically: None


## Smoke Testing Guide:
* From the project root, run these PowerShell commands:

```
# Build the JAR
$env:GRADLE_USER_HOME = "$pwd\.gradle-home"
.\gradlew.bat shadowJar

# Create an empty smoke-test folder
New-Item -ItemType Directory -Force "$env:TEMP\es-jar-smoke-test" | Out-Null

# Copy only the JAR into it
Copy-Item "build\libs\Es.jar" "$env:TEMP\es-jar-smoke-test\Es.jar"

# Navigate to the empty folder
Set-Location "$env:TEMP\es-jar-smoke-test"

# Run the JAR
java -jar "Es.jar"
```

The GUI should open. Test a few commands such as:
todo read book
list
mark 1
unmark 1
find book
bye

## Guide for Testers:
* Post screenshots from your smoke tests
* Mention which OS you used for testing


