        2. Check that the window can be resized and that the content responds appropriately.
        3. Todo, Deadline, Event, mark, unmark, edit, delete, find tasks by keyword, view tasks on specified date
        4. Create a deadline and verify its date and time
        5. Create an event and verify its start and end times (end time before start time should show an error message)
