<panel  popup-url="https://github.com/NUS-CS2103-AY2627-S1/forum/issues/73#issuecomment-5486757887" expanded>
<div slot="header">

**1 :fas-comment:**
</div>

`Storage.deserialize` catches `ChinException` and returns `null`, so pre-Level-8 bad-date lines silently skip on load. File self-heals on the next save.
</panel>

</panel>


