You could consider utilising this [caveman skill](https://github.com/juliusbrussee/caveman). essentially what it does is it forces the model to strip out conversational filler, hedging, and pleasantries in favour of terse, fragment-style technical responses, thereby cutting token usage up to 65%. 

If you're conveniently looking for a mobile plan maybe this would be helpful too :)

