### 401. UMAI..AIZA `@Umaiza-15` (1 posts) 
</div>


<panel  popup-url="https://github.com/NUS-CS2103-AY2627-S1/forum/issues/524" expanded>
<div slot="header">

**1. :fas-info-circle: Request to help with smoke testing JAR file**
</div>

# Smoke Test Request for Judey

Hi everyone! I would appreciate your help testing my application, Judey.

- **JAR file:** [Download Judey](https://github.com/Umaiza-15/ip/releases/download/A-Release3/judey.jar)
- **User Guide:** [Judey User Guide](https://umaiza-15.github.io/ip/)
- **Operating systems to test:** Windows, macOS, and Linux

## Things to Check

Please check the following:

- Judey launches successfully from the downloaded JAR.
- The GUI displays the Judey title, welcome message, input box, and Send button correctly.
- Tasks can be added, listed, completed, uncompleted, deleted, searched, and filtered by date.
- The `help` command displays the available commands and formats.
- Invalid or incomplete commands show helpful error messages without crashing the application.
- Missing or corrupted save data is handled gracefully.
- Tasks remain available after closing and restarting Judey.
- The GUI background, task messages, error messages, and highlighted invalid arguments display correctly.

## Suggested Smoke-Test Run

Please perform the following tests in a new empty folder so that the results are easier to verify.

### 1. Add a todo

'''text
todo buy groceries
'''

**Expected result:**

- Judey confirms that the task was added.
- The task is identified as a todo.
- The task is initially incomplete.

### 2. Add a deadline

'''text
deadline submit report /by 31/12/2026 2359
'''

**Expected result:**

- Judey confirms that the deadline was added.
- The deadline date and time are displayed correctly.

### 3. Add an event

'''text
event team meeting /from 1/1/2027 1400 /to 1/1/2027 1500
'''

**Expected result:**

- Judey confirms that the event was added.
- The event start and end times are displayed correctly.

### 4. List all tasks

'''text
list
'''

**Expected result:**

- All three tasks are displayed.
- Each task has the correct task number and type.
- The todo, deadline, and event are shown as incomplete.

### 5. Mark a task as complete

'''text
mark 1
'''

**Expected result:**

- Judey confirms that task 1 was marked as complete.

Run:

'''text
list
'''

**Expected result:**

- `buy groceries` is now shown as completed.

### 6. Search for a task

'''text
find report
'''

**Expected result:**

- The `submit report` deadline is displayed.
- The matching task keeps its original task number.

### 7. Find tasks on a date

'''text
events-on 1/1/2027
'''

**Expected result:**

- The `team meeting` event is displayed.
- Its original task number is preserved.

### 8. Delete a task

'''text
delete 1
'''

**Expected result:**

- Judey confirms that task 1 was deleted.

Run:

'''text
list
'''

**Expected result:**

- `buy groceries` is no longer displayed.
- The remaining tasks are still present.

## Invalid-Input Tests

### 9. Missing todo description

'''text
todo
'''

**Expected result:**

- Judey displays an error explaining that the todo description is missing.
- A suggested command format is shown.
- The application continues running.

### 10. Missing deadline information

'''text
deadline submit report
'''

**Expected result:**

- Judey explains that required deadline information is missing.
- The suggested format includes `/by` and the date-time format.
- The application continues running.

### 11. Missing event information

'''text
event team meeting
'''

**Expected result:**

- Judey explains that the event information is incomplete.
- The suggested format includes `/from`, `/to`, and the required date-time format.
- The application continues running.

### 12. Task number entered using words

'''text
mark one
'''

**Expected result:**

- Judey reports that the task number is invalid.
- The suggested format highlights `&lt;task number>`.
- No task is changed.

### 13. Invalid date

'''text
events-on tomorrow
'''

**Expected result:**

- Judey reports that the date is invalid.
- The suggested format highlights the date.
- The application continues running.

### 14. Missing search keyword

'''text
find
'''

**Expected result:**

- Judey reports that a search keyword is missing.
- The suggested format highlights `&lt;keyword>`.
- The application continues running.

### 15. Unknown command

'''text
unknown command
'''

**Expected result:**

- Judey reports that the command is not recognised.
- A list of valid commands is suggested.
- The application continues running.

## Persistence Test

Add a task:

'''text
todo persistence test
'''

**Expected result:**

- Judey confirms that the task was added.

Exit the application:

'''text
bye
'''

**Expected result:**

- Judey displays a goodbye message and closes.

Start Judey again from the same folder and enter:

'''text
list
'''

**Expected result:**

- `persistence test` is still present in the task list.

## Guide for Testers

Please include the following in your report:

- Operating system and version.
- Whether each test passed or failed.
- Screenshots of the main smoke-test results.
- Any unexpected messages, visual issues, or crashes.
- The exact command and steps that caused any issue.

Thank you for helping test Judey!



</panel>

</panel>


