finding, and deleting tasks. Invalid input displayed a helpful error without
crashing the application. The UI, messages, colours, scrolling, and input area
displayed correctly.

I also closed and reopened Nova from the same folder. Running `list` showed the
saved tasks, confirming that persistence works.

I did not encounter any functional issues. The terminal displayed a JavaFX
native-access warning, but it did not affect the application.

