Tested on macOS 26.5 (Apple Silicon), Java 25.0.3. All the commands work.

One small thing: `getResponse()` prints the reply to `System.out` as well as returning it, so every message shows up twice in the terminal you launched the jar from. Harmless for the GUI, looks like a leftover from the console version.

<img width="1029" height="1016" alt="Image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/5310eb87-7294-4da2-b195-c5a4155f6b71" />

Also +1 on @dillionlim's save path point: it's `Path.of("src", "main", "data", "info.txt")` in `panda.gui.Main`, so `data/` alone should do it.
